<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">SAVED RECORDS</view><view class="title">留一份，心里有底</view><view class="subtitle">只显示你主动保存成功的记录</view>
  <view class="card row"><picker mode="date" fields="month" value="{{month}}" start="1900-01" end="9999-12" bindchange="changeMonth"><button class="link">{{month || '全部月份'}}　⌄</button></picker><button class="link" bindtap="all">显示全部</button></view>
  <view class="notice warning" wx:if="{{!ready}}">暂时无法读取个人记录，请确认身份后重试。<button bindtap="sync">重新同步</button></view>
  <view class="notice warning" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry">重试加载</button></view>
  <view class="card empty" wx:if="{{ready && !loading && !error && !records.length}}"><view class="empty-icon">▤</view><view>暂无已保存记录</view><view class="subtitle">核对计算结果后，点击“保存到云端”。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="calculate">前往计算</button></view>
  <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="card">
    <view class="row"><view class="card-title">{{item.month}}</view><view class="tag">已保存</view></view>
    <block wx:if="{{item.compatible}}"><view class="amount small">{{item.amount}}<text class="unit">元</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.hours}} 小时 · {{item.totalLessons}} 节</view></block>
    <view wx:else class="notice warning">此记录需要更新小程序后查看</view>
    <view class="line muted">保存时间 {{item.savedTime}}</view><view class="muted">计费表时间 {{item.configTime}}</view>
    <button bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}">查看记录 ›</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty muted">正在读取记录…</view>
  <button wx:if="{{hasMore && !loading}}" bindtap="more">加载更多</button>
  <view wx:if="{{records.length}}" class="subtitle">同月每条记录独立保留，不自动合计为工资。</view>
</view>
